ne what today is, assuming I could use a calendar with a broad search range. Since the system doesn't provide the current date upfront, I might have to make an educated guess based on available information.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Calculating the current date**\\n\\nI'm thinking I could assume the current date to be around 2025 since the system date isn't provided. It seems like I might need to calculate it based on context clues, possibly inferring the date to be in 2025 or 2026. One example I came across is from March 2, 2026. For now, I’ll focus on searching in email and drive to gather what I need before confirming the date.\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_00c19e1655be99b6016af127750c8087d0b2e628587db8890b\",\"call_id\":\"call_Q3wpWnybgslxjDAEwY6atKbh\",\"name\":\"mail\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"search\\\",\\\"from\\\":\\\"Dana\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"budget\\\",\\\"limit\\\":10}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_00c19e1655be99b6016af127750c9487d0bd2012a547ee5fce\",\"call_id\":\"call_J4V13yF93nQmnOxPjn8Al5Zl\",\"name\":\"drive\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"search\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"budget spreadsheet\\\",\\\"limit\\\":10}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_Q3wpWnybgslxjDAEwY6atKbh\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"messages\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"message\\\": \\\"msg_fdb3aecc0ff64c18\\\",\\n      \\\"thread\\\": \\\"thr_21d851e725704243\\\",\\n      \\\"from\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"to\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"email\\\": \\\"me@example.test\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"Sam Example\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"subject\\\": \\\"Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\n      \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Can you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's review?\\\",\\n      \\\"sent_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-09T08:12:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"unread\\\": true,\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        \\\"INBOX\\\",\\n        \\\"UNREAD\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_J4V13yF93nQmnOxPjn8Al5Zl\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"files\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"file\\\": \\\"file_13cbb092dd3c457b\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Q3 Budget\\\",\\n      \\\"mime_type\\\": \\\"application/vnd.google-apps.spreadsheet\\\",\\n      \\\"modified_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-08T17:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"modified_by\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\",\\n      \\\"native_type\\\": \\\"spreadsheet\\\",\\n      \\\"web_url\\\": \\\"https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}}],\"stream\":true,\"prompt_cache_key\":\"01a1be01-f855-75da-a5e3-4a3173a3f5ed\",\"store\":false,\"max_output_tokens\":128000,\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\",\"summary\":\"auto\"},\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"]}"
          },
