XnvzM_bgGJqgLwKGeQHFVBF8=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying email details**\\n\\nIt looks like I’m confirming today is likely November 9, 2026, which means tomorrow will be November 10. I need to generate a calendar list for that date using UTC, since the time zone isn’t specified. I’ll create a range from 2026-11-10T00:00:00Z to 11-11. I also need to read the email for context, particularly focusing on the meeting details, so I should get both done in parallel.\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_00c19e1655be99b6016af12779558087d0a00beb2eaafc4a56\",\"call_id\":\"call_tmpYAJbkw7XuHwWJ9kTPDaU7\",\"name\":\"calendar\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"list\\\",\\\"from\\\":\\\"2026-11-10T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"to\\\":\\\"2026-11-11T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"limit\\\":100}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_00c19e1655be99b6016af12779559487d0a578057fb1c5bdfc\",\"call_id\":\"call_o1Pgl5ZsspS4wAQEaASAO5lp\",\"name\":\"mail\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"message\\\":\\\"msg_fdb3aecc0ff64c18\\\"}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_tmpYAJbkw7XuHwWJ9kTPDaU7\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"events\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"event\\\": \\\"evt_1b8ae09f16154e29\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Team standup\\\",\\n      \\\"start\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T09:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"end\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T09:15:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"time_zone\\\": \\\"UTC\\\",\\n      \\\"organizer\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"lee@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Lee Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"response\\\": \\\"accepted\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"event\\\": \\\"evt_89ffadc4125b4cd3\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Q3 planning review\\\",\\n      \\\"start\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T14:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"end\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T15:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"time_zone\\\": \\\"UTC\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"Room 4\\\",\\n      \\\"organizer\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\",